                      %mi π
                      %mo :
                      %mi P
                      %mo →
                      %mi M
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi : P \to M
                is a lift of the classifying map to
                %math#mathml_3d720ed6ed4c6f582f4d5f0a2f0840a264d2fa6a_14.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
